---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<Base
  title={`Gorilla Trekking Short Break | 4 Day Bwindi Itinerary | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`A focused 4 day gorilla trekking short break in Uganda, fly to Bwindi for a day with a mountain gorilla family, then unwind beside Lake Bunyonyi. Day by day itinerary and prices from $3,900.`}
  ogTitle={`Gorilla Trekking Short Break | 4 Day Bwindi Itinerary | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`A short, soul stirring gorilla trek in Bwindi plus Lake Bunyonyi, 4 days from $3,900.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/ug-bunyonyi.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/gorilla-trekking-short-break.html`}
  jsonld={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TouristTrip","name":"Gorilla Trekking Short Break — 4-Day Bwindi Itinerary","description":"A focused 4-day Uganda gorilla trekking short break in Bwindi with Lake Bunyonyi.","image":"https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/ug-bunyonyi.jpg","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Rendile Travels"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"3900","priceCurrency":"USD"}}`}
  credit={`Imagery via Wikimedia Commons: Lake Bunyonyi © Sjoerdug; mountain gorilla © Charles J. Sharp; elephant family © Giles Laurent; Murchison Falls © NANTUMBWEJ. Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY-SA</a>.`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-bunyonyi.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Uganda · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Gorilla Trekking Short Break</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>4 days</b></span>
        <span>Bwindi · Lake Bunyonyi</span>
        <span>Private</span>
        <span>from <b>$3,900</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Gorilla%20Trekking%20Short%20Break" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="uganda.html">Uganda</a> / Gorilla Trekking Short Break</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Short on time but set on gorillas? This focused four day break flies you straight to the south west for an unforgettable hour with a mountain gorilla family in Bwindi, then a restful day beside the terraced shores of Lake Bunyonyi.</p>
        <p>The fastest, gentlest way to a life list encounter, easily added to a Kenya or Tanzania safari, or savoured on its own.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 4 day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Bwindi</h3><p>Arrive in Entebbe and connect by light aircraft to the Bwindi airstrip, with the terraced hills unrolling below. Settle into your forest edge lodge and meet your guide.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All from lunch</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking</h3><p>An early briefing, then into the ancient forest with trackers ahead. The moment you reach the family, a silverback at rest, mothers and tumbling youngsters, is one you'll never forget. The afternoon is yours to rest and reflect.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Lake Bunyonyi</h3><p>A short drive to the "place of little birds", a serene day of canoes, birdsong and lakeside calm, or an optional Batwa community visit.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Bunyonyi lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Entebbe &amp; depart</h3><p>A morning by the lake, then a light aircraft flight back to Entebbe for your onward connection.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Lodges</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Gorilla%20Trekking%20Short%20Break"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Bwindi Lodge</h3><p>Forest edge cottages facing gorilla country.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Gorilla%20Trekking%20Short%20Break"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Clouds Mountain Lodge</h3><p>Stone suites high in the Virunga foothills.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Gorilla%20Trekking%20Short%20Break"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Birdnest @ Bunyonyi</h3><p>A calm lakeside retreat among the hills.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Return light aircraft flights from Entebbe</li>
          <li>Hand picked forest &amp; lakeside lodges</li>
          <li>One gorilla permit</li>
          <li>Expert driver guide &amp; ranger fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Lake Bunyonyi canoe excursion</li>
          <li>Drinking water in the vehicle</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$3,900 per person sharing</strong>; single supplement available. International flights, visas and a second gorilla permit are extra. Best in the drier months (June to September &amp; December to February); minimum age 15 for gorilla trekking.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Gorillas, beautifully simple.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and we'll secure your permit, Bwindi's are limited and go early.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Gorilla%20Trekking%20Short%20Break" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More journeys</p><h2 class="section__title">Other Uganda itineraries</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="gorillas-and-chimpanzees.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-bwindi.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Gorillas &amp; Chimpanzees</h3><p>7 days · Bwindi &amp; Kibale.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="classic-uganda-safari.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-qenp.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Classic Uganda Safari</h3><p>10 days · the grand loop.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="uganda.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-murchison.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All Uganda itineraries</h3><p>Browse every Uganda journey.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
